Wan-Dub Causal Forcing++ adaptation

The flow-matching scheduler compatibility code is adapted from the official
Causal-Forcing repository, commit da3ddf1a590f30c9edc568e11c2f77170995c31c,
under Apache-2.0. The license text is retained under
dependencies/licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.

The adjacent-timestep consistency algorithm and re-noising sampler in this
directory are adaptations of model/naive_consistency.py,
utils/wan_wrapper.py, pipeline/causal_inference.py and
pipeline/self_forcing_training.py from that repository. The DMD adapter follows
model/dmd.py with documented differences in gradient truncation and conditioning.

Changes by the Wan-Dub integration: VACE/audio conditions, independent reference,
split-backward CD, sampled-chunk DMD gradients, explicit sampler metadata,
finite jobs, full training-state restore, task-specific GT/Sync objectives and
source-matched validation. See the repository README and
`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` for the public implementation scope.
